    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 5000
  },
  {
    "id": 1004002020070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "…………あん時のステージ、\r\nば～りすごかったね～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400202/1004002020070"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00173",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん。俺、まだあの時のこと考えるもんな",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1004002020080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちも～！\r\n起きた時と、ご飯食べる時と、寝る時と──",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400202/1004002020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こらこら、それは切り替えが大事だぞって\r\n言いたいとこだけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004002020090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "──えへへ～、やけん……\r\nもっかい海に行きたか～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400202/1004002020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004002020100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "お～っきくて、どこまで続いとるかわからんで、\r\nなんが出てきよるかもわからんで……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400202/1004002020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004002020110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ば～りきらきらしとって……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
